<class name="RailVehicleDieselEngine" inherits="RailVehicleEngine" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Diesel engine handler class, for vehicles with a mechanical transmission (gearbox, optional torque converter and retarder).
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		Class handling diesel engines with a mechanical transmission. Vehicles with an electric transmission
		([code]EngineType=DieselElectric[/code]) should use [RailVehicleDieselElectricEngine] instead, which extends this
		class with the electric-transmission-specific FIZ fields (and [member RailVehicleDieselElectricEngine.wwlist]).
	</description>
